<title>INDONESIA: Bank Negara says 1996 net 335 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara says 1996 net 335 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's state-controlled PT Bank Negara Indonesia posted an unaudited net profit of 335 billion rupiah in 1996 against 274 billion rupiah in 1995, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
